      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since `CONFIG_TASK_PROFILING` is enabled on `boten`, `get_time()` already reads `IT83XX_ETWD_ETXCNTOR` on the 8 MHz bus here. Does `IT83XX_INTC_AIVCT` flush a separate write buffer from ETWD?",
